{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45554","headline":"读离骚经 · 贯休","name":"读离骚经","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘江滨，湘江滨，兰红芷白波如银，终须一去呼湘君。\n问湘神，云中君，不知何以交灵均。\n我恐湘江之鱼兮，死後尽爲人。\n曾食灵均之肉兮，个个爲忠臣。\n又想灵均之骨兮终不曲，千年波底色如玉。\n谁能入水少取得，香沐函题贡上国。\n贡上国，即全胜和璞悬瓈，垂棘结绿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45554.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45554","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}